---

const faqs = [
  {
    question: "Can I customize the size, material and design of stone products?",
    answer:
      "Yes. We support custom stone products based on your requirements, including dimensions, stone selection, shapes, surface finishes and design details. You can share drawings, reference images or project specifications for an initial assessment.",
  },
  {
    question: "What is the minimum order quantity (MOQ)?",
    answer:
      "MOQ depends on the product type, design complexity and order requirements. Some custom stone furniture pieces can be made as single-piece orders, while other products or projects may require different quantities. Contact us with your requirements for confirmation.",
  },
  {
    question: "What natural stone materials can you provide?",
    answer:
      "We work with a range of natural stones, including marble, travertine, limestone and onyx. Available options depend on the product design, material specifications and current sourcing conditions. We can help you review suitable materials for your project.",
  },
  {
    question: "Do you support OEM and ODM projects?",
    answer:
      "Yes. We support OEM and ODM development for brands, wholesalers, designers and project buyers. You can provide your own drawings or reference designs, or discuss a new product concept with our team. We coordinate material sourcing, specialized production and finishing requirements.",
  },
  {
    question: "How long does production take?",
    answer:
      "Production time varies according to material availability, product dimensions, design complexity, order quantity and production scheduling. We confirm the estimated lead time after the product specifications and order details have been reviewed.",
  },
  {
    question: "Can you arrange international shipping?",
    answer:
      "Yes. We can coordinate export packaging and international shipping arrangements for overseas orders. Shipping methods, costs and estimated transit times depend on the destination, shipment size and logistics requirements.",
  },
];
---

<section class="home-faq" aria-labelledby="home-faq-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="home-faq-inner">
      <header class="home-faq-header">

        <h2 id="home-faq-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

        <p>
          Everything you need to know about sourcing and customizing natural
          stone products with WIN WIN STONE.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="home-faq-list">
        {faqs.map((faq, index) => (
          <details class="home-faq-item">
            <summary>
              <span class="home-faq-number">
                {String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}
              </span>

              <span class="home-faq-question">{faq.question}</span>

              <span class="home-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </summary>

            <div class="home-faq-answer">
              <p>{faq.answer}</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="home-faq-footer">
        <p>Still have questions about your stone project?</p>
        <a href="/contact/">Talk to Our Team <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
